  "text": "### 5. Specific Responsibilities  \n**Risk Appetite Statement:**\n- Review annually\n- Align with strategic objectives\n- Define tolerances (capital, losses, regulatory)\n- Communicate to business units  \n**Capital Planning:**\n- Annual capital plan review\n- Stress testing scenarios (recession, market shock, fraud)\n- Capital ratio monitoring (quarterly)\n- Dividend/distribution approval (if applicable)  \n**Audit Oversight:**\n- Review Internal Audit plan (annual)\n- Monitor audit findings and remediation\n- Assess Internal Audit independence\n- Approve Internal Audit budget  \n**Regulatory Engagement:**\n- Receive FCA/PRA feedback\n- Approve regulatory responses\n- Discuss regulatory concerns/orders\n- Plan remediation for findings  \n**Board Education:**\n- Annual risk management training\n- Market risk overview (quarterly)\n- Emerging risk briefings\n- Regulatory change updates",
